REM RESTORE ERROR with nothing to restore: "ON ERROR not LOCAL" (53).
REM LOCAL ERROR does nothing in the Z80 version (LOCERR), so in PROCa
REM there is no saved handler; the Z80 version 5.4 says nothing when a
REM LOCAL variable's frame is on top (RESLO2's POP IX overwrites the
REM "nothing restored" flag: as test/diff/d13restoredata)
10 ON ERROR PRINT "outer: ";REPORT$:END
20 PROCa:PRINT "back from PROCa"
30 END
40 DEF PROCa:LOCAL I
50 LOCAL ERROR
60 RESTORE ERROR:PRINT "PROCa: no error"
70 ENDPROC
RUN
